      "writtenOn": "2025-11-17T16:25:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. We do this in kvm_vcpu_reset() anyway, at vCPU creation. [*]\n2. pkvm_vcpu_pvmfw_entry_init() is only called for the primary vCPU, and only if the pVM runs with pvmfw.\n\n[*] Well, not really. I _thought_ we called kvm_vcpu_reset() in pKVM at vCPU creation, but now I see we don\u0027t...",
      "parentUuid": "70865e4b_53d09376",
      "revId": "d57dbce9c3a8e544346764c9c2f3e7675999c97c",
